"Combined list of schemas seen in comun, sv, sv-e and sf (and replicas if "
"applicable). If the old name no longer appears, you can leave the origin "
"empty: 'Verify' only validates the destination (region + delegation); "
"'Correct' reapplies only the defaults (ALTER COLUMN) in that name. To "
"contrast or correct the complete transition (incl. .inc and db_idschema) or "
"to 'Change name', indicate the origin schema when you have it."

