#: frontend/devel_db_admin/view/migraciones_lista.phtml:143
msgid ""
"Los ficheros se leen de db/migrations. Los SQL de estructura se ejecutan "
"primero en la base principal (comun, sv-e) y despues en la replica de "
"lectura (*_select); durante ese proceso se pausan las suscripciones logicas "
"y se reactivan al terminar."
msgstr ""
"Files are read from db/migrations. SQL structure files are executed first in "
"the main database (comun, sv-e) and then in the read replica (*_select); "
"during this process, logical subscriptions are paused and reactivated at the "
"end."

